  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2308.08 Written Acknowledgement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2308.08 Written Acknowledgement.\n\n(a) Prior to being appointed as a vessel agent, the applicant shall obtain written acknowledgement from the city or town clerk in the municipality where the vessel agent is located.\n\n(b) Written acknowledgement shall be a signed and dated letter from the city or town clerk, on letterhead, which acknowledges that the person is a vessel agent in the municipality.\n\nSource. #5283, eff 11-22-91; ss by #6616, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED: 10-25-05\n\nNew. #8506, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRES: 6-5-06; ss and moved by #8617, eff 4-28-06, (from Saf-C 2308.05) EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
